  "non_assets": {
    "_note": "Arm labels that are not an asset at all. A placebo arm must never become a program -- 114 distinct placebo-like intervention strings appeared in this corpus across 319 instances, and without this list 'Placebo' would resolve to one of the largest programs in the landscape. Matched as a whole-string or leading-token rule, never as a substring: 'placebo-controlled voriconazole' is a voriconazole arm.",
